      "writtenOn": "2021-12-24T14:18:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s not possible that a classloader is already there in this case because this method is only called by ZygoteInit and is called only once for each jar.\n\nThere isn\u0027t an exact equivalent of DCHECK in Java, so I\u0027m not sure if it\u0027s common to add a check for things that can never actually happen. However, it\u0027s probably fine to add a check here since this method is not performance critical. Done.",
      "parentUuid": "da0ad665_4b9593c7",
      "revId": "7943e5d3182fd2d476a691ad040e656527a6d987",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
